#!/usr/bin/env python3
# Copyright (C) 2026 Chokri Hammedi (blue0x1) <https://github.com/blue0x1>
# The EmuFive web browser (Internet on the home screen): WebKitGTK, the engine of Safari and GNOME
# Web, full screen and used with the controller. One page at a time, so it stays light on memory.
#
#   Left stick      the pointer (the touchpad too)      X               click (hold to drag)
#   Right stick     scroll                              D-pad           arrow keys
#   O / L1          back                                R1              forward
#   Triangle        type an address or search           Square          type in the chosen text box
#   L2 / R2         zoom out / in                       R3              zoom back to normal
#   OPTIONS         menu: bookmarks, start page, zoom, search engine, mobile sites, clear data
#   PS              back to the home screen (the page opens again next time)
#
# A text box chosen with X opens the on-screen keyboard; what is typed goes in with a paste, so it
# works on any site. Downloads, the camera, the microphone, the location and notifications are
# refused. Cookies (sign-ins) and bookmarks are kept in ~/.local/share/ps5-browser and
# ~/.config/ps5-on-ps4/browser.json.
#
#   ps5-browser [URL]
